# Engine S1 artifact schedules: one fitted model per monthly refit per
# population, ~47MB per (fold, season) and growing with every sub-model that
# adopts S1. Rebuildable by scripts/build_engine_event_round2.py and synced to
# the private HF dataset via scripts/hf_sync_data.py (PM decision 2026-09-10).
